1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,600
Weeks to minutes.

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:04,300
Reuters reports AI at Deutsche Bank.

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,300
Some smaller business-loan decisions are faster.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,900
Faster decisions do not prove financial returns.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,300
Track three numbers.

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,200
One: time to an authorized decision.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:25,700
Two: verified cash effect, after all costs.

8
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:31,100
Three: exception rate and human corrections.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,000
Fictional example: 200 cases each month.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Twenty minutes saved equals 67 hours.

11
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:44,500
Unless costs fall, revenue grows or service improves,

12
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,300
hours saved are not automatically cash savings.

13
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,000
Measure business outcomes, not only the demo.

14
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:54,900
PrismBay AI: practical AI business systems.
